## 🪜 Value Proposition Ladder ("The Hook")

### The Design Philosophy: "GitHub for Agents"
We follow the proven model of GitHub/Postman:
- **Free:** Public/Open. Solves individual pain. Builds the network.
- **Paid:** Private/Closed. Solves team pain. Monetizes privacy.

| Tier | User Pain Solved | The "Hook" | Why Pay? |
|------|------------------|------------|----------|
| **Free** | "My agents are dumb & isolated locally." | **God Mode in 5 mins.** Immediate productivity. | N/A - it's the gateway. |
| **Pro ($19)** | "I have secret patterns I can't share." | **Private Pattern Sync.** Keep your competitive edge. | **Privacy & Ownership.** |
| **Team ($99)** | "My team is reinventing the wheel." | **Shared Team Brain.** Consistent agents for everyone. | **Collaboration & Speed.** |

