## Production-Ready Requirements

### 1. Configuration
```bash
# Environment variables
NUCLEAR_BRAIN_PATH=/path/to/.brain    # Required
NUCLEAR_BRAIN_LOG_LEVEL=INFO          # Optional
NUCLEAR_BRAIN_TELEGRAM_TOKEN=xxx      # Optional: alerts
